          <mxGeometry height="26" width="560" x="1840.0130399816176" y="4381.67973058364" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OZcM1zfR8Zn_qaSWvsLe-151" parent="KVJi7bsxJDHXnZhBuliu-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="• Maker-initiated path for a corporate cardholder (NAHC = the user-facing name for the same backend role). A Maker (holds make_transfer_by_client) applies for a card on behalf of a target NAHC; a Checker (holds check_transfer_by_client) approves. Structurally identical to CARD_APPLY_SELF — only the initiator, the approval stage (checker), and the subject user differ.&#xa;&#xa;• An NAHC has no wallet of their own (the &quot;top up without wallet&quot; role, initiate_card_top_up_without_wallet). The issuance cost is charged from a company wallet — cold or cold-plus — that the maker picks.&#xa;&#xa;• The NAHC role is checked ONCE, at creation, and never again. A subject switched from NAHC to account_holder between create and approval is still approved and issued the card (an account_holder owns a card just the same) — re-checking the role later would wrongly error. Only the subject&#39;s status (active / blocked) is re-checked immediately before the checker&#39;s approval.&#xa;&#xa;• A blocked subject at approval → 403 invalid_target_user: the approval is refused and the checker rejects the request themselves (there is no auto-cancel).&#xa;&#xa;• Reassign on approver role change: if the assigned checker loses check_transfer_by_client before deciding, that stage&#39;s assigned_to is cleared so another checker can pick it up.&#xa;&#xa;• The card is delivered to, and activated by, the NAHC themselves (Stages 3–4) on their own device.&#xa;&#xa;• Cancel is maker-only, and only while no checker has picked up the stage." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="620" width="560" x="1840.0130399816176" y="4413.67973058364" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="05 - CARD_TOPUP_SELF" id="iIk_LD4LzNC6jLIek2IG">
    <mxGraphModel dx="-434" dy="-1249" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="850" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-0" />
        <mxCell id="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-0" />
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-76" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" value="CARD_TOPUP_SELF — an account holder tops up their own card (end-to-end)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1150" x="2797.370279947918" y="2279.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-77" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=2;" value="A top-up moves crypto from a company wallet onto a cardholder&#39;s card. This action only quotes, locks, and gates the request (Phase 1); the actual money movement is the shared deposit pipeline (Phases 2–4), which routes the funds: customer wallet → UQPay ramp → off-ramp to USD → banking account → issuing account → card. The full fee waterfall is locked on the request at creation and executed as locked, never recomputed. An NAHC tops up via the maker paths (CARD_TOPUP_NAHC), not here." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="1050" x="2797.370279947918" y="2313.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-78" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="30" x="3322.370279947918" y="2423.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-79" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=2;startSize=46;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#44546a;strokeColor=#44546a;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f9fc;" value="PHASE 1 · APPROVAL — CARD_TOPUP_SELF (quote + lock)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="820" width="640" x="3017.370279947918" y="2483.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-80" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-79" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;①&amp;nbsp; Create — quote &amp; lock&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(the account holder, on their own active card)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• pick the funding wallet (company cold or cold-plus) and the coin (USDC or USDT)&lt;br&gt;• enter the amount one of two ways — F (lands on the card) or D (max spend / charged)&lt;br&gt;• the system computes the full fee waterfall (see panel below) and checks UQPay&#39;s ramp will accept this deposit — the chosen coin&#39;s deposit network is open and the forwarded amount clears its minimum&lt;br&gt;• review the quotation → confirm with a one-time code (OTP)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="580" x="30" y="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-81" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-79" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;②&amp;nbsp; Save the request and hold the funds&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_tasks ← insert { subject = CARD_TOPUP_SELF, card_id = target card, payload = the locked waterfall, status = &#39;pending&#39; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_task_approvals ← insert { stage = 1, required_approval_role = &#39;account_holder&#39;, decision = &#39;pending&#39;, assigned_to = NULL }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• hold (lock) D + gas on the chosen wallet&lt;br&gt;• notify the company&#39;s other account holders" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="580" x="30" y="248" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-82" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-79" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;③&amp;nbsp; Another account holder decides&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;one-time code on approve;&lt;br&gt;the initiator is re-checked as still active,&lt;br&gt;and the ramp config is re-validated" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="440" x="100" y="468" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-83" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-79" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;④&amp;nbsp; Approved&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_tasks.status ← &#39;approved&#39;&lt;/span&gt; → hand off to the deposit pipeline" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="580" x="30" y="718" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-84" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=2;startSize=46;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#44546a;strokeColor=#44546a;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f9fc;" value="PHASE 2 · DEPOSIT PIPELINE — legs 1–3 (wallet → ramp → banking)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1174" width="640" x="3017.370279947918" y="3363.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-85" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-84" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑤&amp;nbsp; Create the deposit request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests ← insert { status = &#39;pending&#39;, pipeline_status = &#39;pending_deposit_into_topup_wallet&#39; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• every amount is copied from the locked payload — never recomputed" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="580" x="30" y="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-86" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-84" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑥&amp;nbsp; Leg 1 — customer wallet → card top-up wallet (move D)&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(an on-chain Hextrust transfer, type card_topup)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• move D (the grossed-up charge) from the maker-chosen company wallet into our own card top-up wallet&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(122, 59, 156);&quot;&gt;transaction_history + transaction_request&lt;/span&gt; record the transfer&lt;br&gt;• wait for confirmed on-chain success" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="580" x="30" y="198" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-87" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-84" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑦&amp;nbsp; Leg 1 confirmed → book revenue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the retained net revenue (D − G) has now landed in the card top-up wallet&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;revenue_records ← insert { entry_type = &#39;earn&#39;, source_type = &#39;card_deposit&#39;, net_revenue = D − G }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests.pipeline_status → pending_deposit_into_ramp_account&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="580" x="30" y="402" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-88" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-84" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑧&amp;nbsp; Leg 2 — card top-up wallet → UQPay ramp (forward G)&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(an on-chain Hextrust transfer, type deposit_to_ramp)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• send G on-chain to UQPay&#39;s ramp deposit address; save the transaction&#39;s on-chain hash on &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests.blockchain_hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• track it with a poll-only op row (an on-chain deposit can&#39;t be re-sent): &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;pending_operations ← insert { operation = &#39;ramp_deposit&#39;, reference_type = &#39;blockchain_hash&#39;, reference_id = the hash }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• a scheduler polls UQPay List Deposits (&lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#00499c;&#39;&gt;GET /api/v1/ramp/deposit&lt;/span&gt;) and matches our hash to the response&#39;s txid to find the deposit order → saves &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests.ramp_deposit_order_id&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="580" x="30" y="576" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-89" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-84" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑨&amp;nbsp; UQPay confirms the deposit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the ramp.deposit.success webhook arrives (matched to this request by data.txid = deposit_requests.blockchain_hash); the List Deposits poll is the backup&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests.pipeline_status → pending_offramp_conversion&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="580" x="30" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-90" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-84" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑩&amp;nbsp; Leg 3 — off-ramp to USD, then ramp → banking&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(the ramp &amp; banking accounts are both on UQPay)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• create a quote → off-ramp crypto → USD (A = 0.25%) → I sits in the ramp account&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests.pipeline_status → pending_ramp_to_banking_transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• transfer the ramp account → the banking account&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests.pipeline_status → pending_bank_to_issuing_settlement&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="580" x="30" y="994" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-95" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=2;startSize=46;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#44546a;strokeColor=#44546a;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f9fc;" value="PHASE 4 · LEG 5 — recharge the card (send the locked F)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="460" width="640" x="3017.370279947918" y="5327.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-96" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-95" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑭&amp;nbsp; Recharge the card&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;pending_operations ← insert { operation = &#39;recharge&#39; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#00499c;&#39;&gt;POST /v1/issuing/cards/{id}/recharge&lt;/span&gt; (Card Recharge, amount = the full locked F)&lt;br&gt;• confirmed by the &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#00499c;&#39;&gt;card.recharge.succeeded&lt;/span&gt; webhook (or the Retrieve Card Order poll)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="580" x="30" y="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-97" parent="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-95" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑮&amp;nbsp; Recharged  🎉&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;deposit_requests.pipeline_status → recharged,  deposit_requests.status → success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• set the card balance from the webhook&#39;s card_available_balance (authoritative — not a blind + F)&lt;br&gt;• email the cardholder — the top-up is done" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="580" x="30" y="248" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-98" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Precondition not met → no request created&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• must be the initiator&#39;s OWN active card (cards.internal_status = &#39;active&#39;) — else 403 invalid_card_action&lt;br&gt;• the chosen wallet must cover D + gas; amount &amp;gt; 0&lt;br&gt;• UQPay&#39;s ramp must accept it (deposit_enabled = true AND forwarded amount G ≥ min_deposit_amount)&lt;br&gt;• otherwise refused right away — no card_tasks row, no hold" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="360" x="3737.370279947918" y="2537.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-99" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cancel (initiator only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• allowed only before an approver picks it up&lt;br&gt;• card_tasks.status = &#39;cancelled&#39;, release the hold" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="360" x="3737.370279947918" y="2743.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-100" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rejected, or checks fail at approval&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• initiator blocked → 403 invalid_target_user; the approver rejects it&lt;br&gt;• the ramp config is re-validated at approval and can also reject&lt;br&gt;• card_tasks.status = &#39;rejected&#39;, release the hold, notify, stop — nothing moved" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="360" x="3737.370279947918" y="2933.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-101" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Leg 1 or leg 2 fails (on-chain transfer, Hextrust)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the transfer can&#39;t broadcast, or fails on-chain → the request just holds at its current deposit_requests.pipeline_status&lt;br&gt;• retried in Hextrust Monitoring — the Deposit Requests list shows a redirect link into it; there is no retry button here" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="360" x="3737.370279947918" y="3619.5927734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-102" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Travel rule required&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(the ramp.deposit.pending webhook carried need_travel_rule = true)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• deposit_requests.pipeline_status = &#39;pending_travel_rule&#39;&lt;br&gt;• submit the sender data; the deposit stays Pending at UQPay until it is verified, then continues to leg 3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="360" x="3829.000279947918" y="3819.0027734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-103" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;UQPay rejects the deposit &amp; returns the funds&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(deposit_requests.pipeline_status = &#39;ramp_deposit_failed&#39;)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the on-chain transfer succeeded but UQPay rejected the deposit and sends the funds back to our card top-up wallet&lt;br&gt;• retry from the Deposit Requests list — enabled only once the returned funds are confirmed back (deposit_requests.refund_blockchain_hash set)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="360" x="3829.000279947918" y="3986.0027734375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-108" edge="1" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" source="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-78" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;" target="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-79">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-109" edge="1" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" source="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-80" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;" target="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-81" value="OTP ok">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-110" edge="1" parent="8LXdY-D83wv9_5kYqO0z-1" source="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-81" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;" target="Q_nuJXuJ8KCzDTo-LM33-82">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
