        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-203" edge="1" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" source="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-171" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-180" value="fails">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-204" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Two statuses on the request" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="680" x="1369.6666395664215" y="4285.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-205" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="deposit_requests carries TWO statuses:&#xa;&#xa;• status — customer-facing: pending → success. Stays &#39;pending&#39; through the WHOLE pipeline, including any *_failed step awaiting admin retry. &#39;failed&#39; is reserved for a non-retryable request and NO step sets it today.&#xa;• pipeline_status — the detailed internal stage AND the concurrency guard (there is no inflight_operation column on deposit_requests).&#xa;&#xa;pipeline_status rail:&#xa;   pending_deposit_into_topup_wallet → pending_deposit_into_ramp_account&#xa;   → (pending_travel_rule) → pending_offramp_conversion → pending_ramp_to_banking_transfer&#xa;   → pending_bank_to_issuing_settlement → pending_bank_to_issuing_settlement_approval&#xa;   → pending_card_recharge → recharged&#xa;   failure states (status stays &#39;pending&#39;):  ramp_deposit_failed · offramp_failed · ramp_to_banking_transfer_failed · card_recharge_failed" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="680" x="1369.6666395664215" y="4317.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-206" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Who owns each failure (there is no auto-retry anywhere)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="680" x="1369.6666395664215" y="4615.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-207" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="• Hextrust legs 1 &amp; 2 → retried in Hextrust Monitoring. On the Deposit Requests list they show only a redirect link into it — no retry button, no *_failed status (the request just holds at its pending_* stage).&#xa;• UQPay legs (ramp_deposit_failed / offramp_failed / ramp_to_banking_transfer_failed / card_recharge_failed) → retried inline from the Deposit Requests list: a View modal shows the raw error (deposit_requests.last_failure_response — one column, overwritten per failure) + an inline Retry button.&#xa;• Leg 4 settlement → the permissions_tasks admin maker/checker engine.&#xa;&#xa;Notifications: every *_failed step alerts an ADMIN. The CUSTOMER is never notified mid-pipeline — status stays &#39;pending&#39; throughout; a customer failure email would fire only if status=&#39;failed&#39;, which no step sets." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="680" x="1369.6666395664215" y="4647.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-208" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Where the money sits at each leg" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="680" x="1369.6666395664215" y="4895.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-209" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="• customer wallet — the company cold / cold-plus wallet the top-up is funded from (our Hextrust wallet)&#xa;• card top-up wallet — one of OUR Hextrust system wallets; the net revenue (D − G) stays here&#xa;• ramp account / banking account / issuing account — all UQPay-side accounts&#xa;• the card — the cardholder&#39;s card, credited by the final recharge" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="680" x="1369.6666395664215" y="4927.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-210" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Legend" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="285" x="1369.6666395664215" y="5095.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-211" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="1379.6666395664215" y="5127.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-212" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="system / engine action (Hextrust &amp; UQPay legs)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="1411.6666395664215" y="5127.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-213" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="1379.6666395664215" y="5157.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-214" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="success / status advance" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="1411.6666395664215" y="5157.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-215" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="1379.6666395664215" y="5187.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-216" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="waiting on a webhook/poll, or a decision" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="1411.6666395664215" y="5187.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-217" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="1379.6666395664215" y="5217.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-218" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="failure / exception (with its follow-up)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="1411.6666395664215" y="5217.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-219" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="1379.6666395664215" y="5247.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-220" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="admin / manual step" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="1411.6666395664215" y="5247.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-221" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;table ← insert&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;=&amp;nbsp; a database write / read" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="440" x="1379.6666395664215" y="5279.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-222" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#00499c;&#39;&gt;POST /v1/... , webhook.name&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;=&amp;nbsp; a UQPay API call / webhook" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="480" x="1379.6666395664215" y="5307.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-223" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Developer notes" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="600" x="2089.6666395664215" y="4285.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0w2AsphbZHuvDeErsv3-224" parent="mC95enJp4ef7IGxJOfpS-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="• This is the shared execution both top-up entry actions hand off to. It is also reused (legs 2–4, no customer leg) by the Phase-2 auto-top-up funding, whose leg-2 outflow uses a distinct Hextrust type auto_funding_to_ramp so treasury can tell them apart.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The two transfer handles (cwc_to_card_top_up_tr_id, card_top_up_to_ramp_tr_id) hold the ROOT transaction_request; Hextrust retries hang off it via parent_id, so status is read from the latest child. Leg 2&#39;s handle + blockchain_hash are re-pointed only on a ramp_deposit_failed re-dispatch (a brand-new transfer).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• create-quote is folded into pending_offramp_conversion — there is no pending_create_quote stage and no persisted uqpay_quote_id (the quote is consumed immediately; a retry makes a fresh one).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The card balance after recharge is set from the webhook&#39;s card_available_balance (authoritative), not increment based on our internal records.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The tracking op rows (pending_operations) are poll + webhook safety nets; a missing webhook is not a failure — the poll catches it and the request simply waits at its pending_* stage.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1020" width="600" x="2089.6666395664215" y="4317.333312988281" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="08 - CARD_REPLACE_SELF" id="RltORoW30tLfBJRG2rJ6">
    <mxGraphModel dx="-1215" dy="-2137" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="850" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-0" />
        <mxCell id="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-0" />
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-0" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" value="CARD_REPLACE_SELF — an account holder replaces their own card (end-to-end)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1150" x="4278.88929605484" y="3550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-1" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=2;" value="The self-service replacement: an account holder swaps one of their own live cards for a new one. Structurally it is a normal card application PLUS two extra legs — on approval the OLD card is closed first (so spend stops and the reapply slot opens), then a fresh application issues the NEW card, and once the old card fully closes its leftover balance is rolled onto the new card (by us, no fee). The replacement fee is always charged, exactly like a fresh application. An NAHC&#39;s card is replaced via the maker path (CARD_REPLACE_NAHC), not here." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="104" width="1060" x="4278.88929605484" y="3584" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-2" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="30" x="4803.88929605484" y="3706" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-3" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=2;startSize=46;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#44546a;strokeColor=#44546a;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f9fc;" value="PHASE 1 · APPROVAL — CARD_REPLACE_SELF (one stage · account_holder)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="810" width="640" x="4498.88929605484" y="3766" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-4" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;①&amp;nbsp; Create — request the replacement&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(the account holder, on the card being replaced)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• confirm the OLD card being replaced (a live card: cards.internal_status ∈ {active, frozen})&lt;br&gt;• pick the funding wallet (company cold or cold-plus) and the coin (USDC or USDT) for the replacement fee&lt;br&gt;• pick the delivery address for the new card&lt;br&gt;• confirm with a one-time code (OTP)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="580" x="30" y="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-5" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;②&amp;nbsp; Save the request and hold the fee&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_tasks ← insert { subject = CARD_REPLACE_SELF, card_id = the OLD card, payload = { source_wallet, issuance_cost_currency/amount, delivery_address }, status = &#39;pending&#39; }&lt;/span&gt; — card_id NAMES the old card (it becomes card_applications.replaces_card_id at execution)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_task_approvals ← insert { stage 1, required_approval_role = &#39;account_holder&#39;, decision = &#39;pending&#39; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• hold (lock) the replacement fee + gas on the chosen wallet&lt;br&gt;• notify the company&#39;s other account holders" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="580" x="30" y="248" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-6" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-3" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;③&amp;nbsp; Another account holder decides&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;OTP on approve. Re-check TWO things:&lt;br&gt;• the initiator is still active&lt;br&gt;• the OLD card is still replaceable — cards.internal_status ∈ {active, frozen} and no cards.inflight_operation" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="480" x="80" y="468" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-7" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;④&amp;nbsp; Approved&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_tasks.status ← &#39;approved&#39;&lt;/span&gt; → start execution (close the old card, then issue the new one)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="580" x="30" y="708" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-8" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=2;startSize=46;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#44546a;strokeColor=#44546a;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f9fc;" value="PHASE 2 · EXECUTION — close the OLD card, then issue the NEW one (on approval, in order)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1060" width="640" x="4498.88929605484" y="4636" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-9" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑤&amp;nbsp; Re-confirm the wallet is still funded&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(before anything is closed)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• re-check the chosen wallet still holds the fee + gas&lt;br&gt;• this runs BEFORE the old card is closed, so a funding shortfall never strands a closed card" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="580" x="30" y="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-10" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑥&amp;nbsp; Close the OLD card&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(the shared close op — internal-first)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;cards.internal_status → &#39;ongoing_close&#39;&lt;/span&gt; on the old card at once: spend is denied immediately, the reapply slot opens, the owner is notified &#39;card closing&#39;&lt;br&gt;• then an async CANCELLED push to UQPay: &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;pending_operations ← insert { operation = &#39;uq_close&#39; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the old card walks ongoing_close → closed over the ~30-day settlement tail; its leftover balance is captured on the full-close webhook into &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;cards.final_card_balance&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="580" x="30" y="204" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-11" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑦&amp;nbsp; Create the NEW application&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_applications ← insert { status = &#39;pending_issuance_charge&#39;, replaces_card_id = the old card, balance_rollover_status = NULL }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• replaces_card_id links the new card back to the closing one — the rollover (Phase 3) keys on it" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="580" x="30" y="434" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-12" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑧&amp;nbsp; Charge the replacement fee&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(customer wallet → card top-up wallet)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• move the fee on-chain (a Hextrust transfer); on confirmed success → &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_applications.status: pending_issuance_charge → pending_cardholder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the fee is always charged, exactly like a fresh application" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="580" x="30" y="594" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-13" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑨&amp;nbsp; Cardholder — reuse&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the initiator already has an active cardholder from the old card → pure reuse, NO UQPay create-cardholder call&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_applications.status → pending_delivery&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="580" x="30" y="744" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-14" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑩&amp;nbsp; Deliver → assign → activate&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(Stages 2–4, same as a fresh application)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• admin delivers the new card; the owner assigns it (Assign Card) and activates it (Activate Card); limits are pushed once&lt;br&gt;• the NEW card reaches &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;cards.internal_status = &#39;active&#39;&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_applications.status = &#39;activated&#39;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="580" x="30" y="884" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-15" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=2;startSize=46;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#44546a;strokeColor=#44546a;swimlaneFillColor=#f7f9fc;" value="PHASE 3 · BALANCE ROLLOVER — move the old card&#39;s leftover balance to the new card (net-new leg)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="630" width="800" x="4498.89" y="5756" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-16" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-15" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑪&amp;nbsp; Wait until BOTH are true&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(they can finish in either order)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the OLD card is fully closed: &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;cards.internal_status = &#39;closed&#39;&lt;/span&gt; (UQPay CANCELLED) AND &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;cards.final_card_balance IS NOT NULL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the NEW card is &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;cards.internal_status = &#39;active&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• eligibility is re-checked at BOTH completion points (old card CANCELLED via the close reconcile; new card active at Stage 4)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="580" x="30" y="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-17" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-15" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑫&amp;nbsp; Dispatch the rollover&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(by us — no fee, no revenue, no customer-wallet movement)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• concurrency guard (no worklist): compare-and-set &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_applications.balance_rollover_status = &#39;pending&#39; WHERE balance_rollover_status IN (NULL, &#39;failed&#39;)&lt;/span&gt; — a duplicate dispatch from the two trigger points is a no-op (there is no cards.inflight_operation; the guard lives on the application)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;pending_operations ← insert { entity_type=&#39;card&#39;, entity_id = new card, operation = &#39;balance_rollover&#39;, reference_type = &#39;card_order_id&#39; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#00499c;&#39;&gt;POST /v1/issuing/cards/{new card}/recharge&lt;/span&gt; (Card Recharge, amount = the old card&#39;s final_card_balance read live, fresh idempotency key) → store &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;reference_id = card_order_id&lt;/span&gt; from the response" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="580" x="30" y="234" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-18" parent="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-15" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑬&amp;nbsp; Rolled over  🎉&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• confirmed by the &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#00499c;&#39;&gt;card.recharge.succeeded&lt;/span&gt; webhook, matched to the op by &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;source_id = the stored reference_id (card_order_id)&lt;/span&gt; (or the Retrieve Card Order poll)&lt;br&gt;• set the new card balance from &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;data.card_available_balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• delete the op row → &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_applications.balance_rollover_status = &#39;rolled_over&#39;, balance_rolled_over_at = now&lt;/span&gt; (reached from the op&#39;s new card via cards.card_application_id) — the stamp makes the rollover run exactly once&lt;br&gt;• notify the owner &#39;balance moved to your new card&#39;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="580" x="30" y="464" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-19" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Precondition not met → no request created&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the named card must be the initiator&#39;s OWN live card — cards.internal_status ∈ {active, frozen} (the inverse of a fresh apply); anything else → 403 invalid_card_action&lt;br&gt;• no cards.inflight_operation on it, and no pending customer close/replacement on it (a card_tasks row, status=&#39;pending&#39;, subject ∈ {CARD_CLOSE_NAHC, CARD_REPLACE_SELF, CARD_REPLACE_NAHC})&lt;br&gt;• ≤ 1 active application (no card_applications with status ≠ activated)&lt;br&gt;• the chosen wallet must cover the fee + gas&lt;br&gt;• otherwise refused right away — no card_tasks row, no hold, the old card untouched" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="360" x="5218.88929605484" y="3820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-20" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cancel (initiator only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• allowed only before an approver picks it up&lt;br&gt;• card_tasks.status = &#39;cancelled&#39;, release the hold; the old card is untouched" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="360" x="5218.88929605484" y="4030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-21" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rejected, or the checks fail at approval&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• initiator blocked → 403 invalid_target_user&lt;br&gt;• old card no longer replaceable: already ongoing_close/closed/removed → 403 invalid_card_action; an op in flight → 409 card_operation_in_progress&lt;br&gt;• the approver rejects → card_tasks.status = &#39;rejected&#39;, release the hold, notify — the OLD CARD IS UNTOUCHED, nothing was charged" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="360" x="5218.88929605484" y="4230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-22" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Wallet short at the approval re-check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the chosen wallet no longer holds the fee + gas → the approval is rejected&lt;br&gt;• because this re-check runs BEFORE the close, nothing is closed and nothing is charged — a shortfall never strands a closed card" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="360" x="5218.88929605484" y="4680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-23" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Old-card close push fails&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(sync 4xx / card.status.update.failed / poll FAILED)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the old card STAYS cards.internal_status = &#39;ongoing_close&#39; — it is never un-closed&lt;br&gt;• follow-up: the card_status_sync_retry admin worklist drives the retry to UQPay; the new application proceeds regardless (spend is denied on the old card locally while UQPay lags)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="360" x="5218.88929605484" y="4850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-24" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Replacement-fee charge stuck / fails on-chain&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• the new application holds at card_applications.status = &#39;pending_issuance_charge&#39;&lt;br&gt;• follow-up: retried via Hextrust Monitoring; once it confirms, execution auto-continues&lt;br&gt;• note: the OLD card is already &#39;ongoing_close&#39; (closed in ⑥, before the charge) — the replacement is in progress; the stuck charge only delays the new card" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="360" x="5218.88929605484" y="5230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-25" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Balance rollover fails definitively&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(card.recharge.failed / poll FAILED)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• delete the op row → &lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;card_applications.balance_rollover_status = &#39;failed&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• follow-up: create the card_balance_rollover_retry admin worklist (if none exists); an admin retries, which re-runs the compare-and-set (failed → pending) and re-dispatches the Card Recharge&lt;br&gt;• a still-&#39;pending&#39; order is NEVER auto-retried (a succeeded-but-unconfirmed recharge must not double); the new card is fully usable meanwhile — only the old balance is pending" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="360" x="5421.99929605484" y="5952" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-26" edge="1" parent="UGrVtaiaCgaz2CvJc4yu-1" source="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;" target="2sb_w9JU7IRoKLnbps9l-3">
