        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-47" edge="1" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" source="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-17" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-26" value="fails">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-48" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="The reapply gate is INVERTED versus a fresh application" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="680" x="5868.88925075531" y="5720.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-49" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="• a fresh apply requires NO active card.&#xa;• a replacement requires EXACTLY the one live card it names (card_tasks.card_id) — the target NAHC&#39;s card, which IS the thing being replaced.&#xa;&#xa;The ≤1-active-application half still holds (no other application in flight for the NAHC). The ≤1-active-card invariant is preserved by ORDERING — close the old card first (→ ongoing_close), create the new application second — never by holding two active cards at once." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="680" x="5868.88925075531" y="5752.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-50" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Balance-rollover eligibility" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="680" x="5868.88925075531" y="5940.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-51" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="Runs only when ALL THREE hold (never at ongoing_close — UQPay is still settling):&#xa;• old card cards.internal_status = &#39;closed&#39; (UQPay CANCELLED)&#xa;• old card cards.final_card_balance IS NOT NULL&#xa;• new card cards.internal_status = &#39;active&#39;&#xa;&#xa;Re-checked at both points that can satisfy it last (old card CANCELLED; new card active) — they finish in either order. balance_rolled_over_at stamps the one-time success; a still-&#39;pending&#39; order is never auto-retried. By us: no fee, no revenue, no customer-wallet movement (contrast a paid top-up)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="680" x="5868.88925075531" y="5972.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-52" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Status fields that move through the flow" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="680" x="5868.88925075531" y="6190.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-53" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="card_tasks.status:  pending → approved  (or rejected / cancelled)&#xa;&#xa;card_applications.status:  pending_issuance_charge → pending_cardholder → pending_delivery → delivered → activated&#xa;   (+ replaces_card_id = the old card;  balance_rollover_status: NULL → pending → rolled_over / failed;  balance_rolled_over_at)&#xa;&#xa;cards.internal_status (OLD card):  active / frozen → ongoing_close → closed → (removed)   ·   final_card_balance captured at &#39;closed&#39;&#xa;cards.internal_status (NEW card):  (none) → pending_assignation → pending_activation → active" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="680" x="5868.88925075531" y="6222.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-54" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Legend" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="285" x="5868.88925075531" y="6470.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-55" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="5878.88925075531" y="6502.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-56" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="system / engine action" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="5910.88925075531" y="6502.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-57" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="5878.88925075531" y="6532.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-58" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="success / status advance / card active / no-op accepted" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="5910.88925075531" y="6532.259440104167" as="geometry" />
