        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-59" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="5878.88925075531" y="6562.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-60" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="decision / waiting" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="5910.88925075531" y="6562.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-61" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="22" x="5878.88925075531" y="6592.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-62" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="failure / exception (with its follow-up)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="5910.88925075531" y="6592.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-63" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#7a3b9c;&#39;&gt;table ← insert&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;=&amp;nbsp; a database write / read" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="440" x="5878.88925075531" y="6624.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-64" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;span style=&#39;font-family:Courier New,monospace;color:#00499c;&#39;&gt;POST /v1/... , webhook.name&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;=&amp;nbsp; a UQPay API call / webhook" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="480" x="5878.88925075531" y="6652.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-65" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" value="Developer notes" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="600" x="6588.88925075531" y="5720.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="daHSXicIUf_iNyanYbEl-66" parent="fdiY78E_wBlVqpb2p_Ax-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=12;spacingLeft=14;" value="• The NAHC role is checked ONCE, at creation, and never again. A subject switched NAHC → account_holder between create and approval is still replaced (they still own the card). Only the subject&#39;s status (active / blocked) is re-checked, immediately before the checker&#39;s approval.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Execution is IDENTICAL to CARD_REPLACE_SELF: close the old card first (internal-first → ongoing_close; the async CANCELLED push, on failure, drives card_status_sync_retry without un-closing), then the apply chain (cardholder always a REUSE — no UQPay create-cardholder call), then the balance rollover once the old card is &#39;closed&#39; with final_card_balance and the new card is &#39;active&#39;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Close-first ordering keeps the ≤1-active-card invariant true." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="960" width="600" x="6576.99925075531" y="5746.259440104167" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
